WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:08.580
Missile maintenance in the United States Air
Force. I was a staff sergeant. A lot of other

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.090
schools are just giving you a piece of paper
for your degree. Hillsdale, you're actually

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:16.910
getting an education that you can use. Core
curriculum is tough. Right now, I'm in the

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:22.210
Western Heritage and the Constitution 101
course. And so, we're learning about the philosophy

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:28.150
of the Greeks and what is politics. Every
student has to go through those and it gives

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:35.550
you a good liberal arts education, a good
grounding in our heritage here. The relationship

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.780
with professors here is really good. They're
small classes so you get to know the professors.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:43.559
The professors know you. If you're struggling
in class, they want you to go to their office

00:00:43.559 --> 00:00:48.780
on their office hours and talk to them and
discuss the concepts, and they're not just

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.480
there during classroom hours. They're there
all the time.

00:00:56.579 --> 00:00:59.710
The vibe at Hillsdale is great. You always
see students out in the quad, talking with

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:04.360
each other and discussing what's been going
on in class. And there's always a lot of back

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:10.340
and forth debate, I guess I would say, about
the different concepts they learned. But it's

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.230
very relaxed and intense at the same time.
Someone who's in the military, I think they

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.860
should really look into Hillsdale. They don't
accept the GI bill here, but they still pay

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:24.040
for everything. They give you a veteran's
scholarship and so you don't have to worry

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:30.530
about the cost. They give you room and board
and meal plan. It is a small school so you

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:34.220
don't transition from the military into this
large school that no one really cares about

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:37.980
you. Here, you have a smaller school where
everyone does care.

